msgid "This page explains five bounded software increments and their assembly and ownership contracts. It helps integrators select the exact mechanism and retain storage through failure. These implementations do not complete the original IO-32/37–42 or SOC-33–35 exit conditions. Physical HIL remains `not_executed`; software development results do not establish a clean software candidate."
